WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
- So, do you think that you
would have the survival skills

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.230
to survive in that kind of
environment, in real life?

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:06.080
- Oh my God, I mean, think
about the way I acted

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.009
