- Yeah.

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:07.842
(everyone laughing)
- You know?

00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:08.675
I don't know. (laughs)
- Who didn't, buddy?

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.000
