00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.400
I mean, I think if I was gonna do it,

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.480
I don't think it would be a very,

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.411
fully functioning experience,

00:00:15.411 --> 00:00:16.850
